---
kind: scene
id: spine.elite.tarrok
title: The Elite Four — Tarrok
on: challenge
target: arena.fistChamber
once: false
when: "@badgeCount >= 8 && holds('defeated', ['frostine']) && !holds('defeated', ['tarrok'])"
---

## The chamber

::bg{location="fistChamber" time="day"}
::actor{character="tarrok" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@tarrok{code="0010"}: I am Tarrok. I trained on a mountain until the mountain gave up. Show me your strongest!
::music{playback="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
::battle{foe="tarrok" kind="elite" resultKey="fight"}
<match subject="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    @tarrok{code="0020"}: Ha! A good fight. My fists are ringing. Go!
    ::assert{defeated(tarrok)}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @tarrok{code="0030"}: Discipline wins. Back to the start with you.
    // the streak breaks: the whole Four must be beaten again
    ::retract{defeated(frostine)}
    ::retract{defeated(tarrok)}
    ::retract{defeated(morwen)}
    ::retract{defeated(drakon)}
  </otherwise>
</match>
